{"availability":"available","full":"WeAreMetaverse/candy-shop","name":"candy-shop","description":"https://liqnft.github.io/solana-candy-shop","category":"Other","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":81,"created":"2022-03-31T21:17:44Z","updated":"2022-03-31T14:20:34Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://liqnft.github.io/candy-shop/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T09:25:55.958Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T09:25:55.958Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T09:25:55.958Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T09:25:55.958Z","stars":0,"forks":81}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Candy Shop is a JavaScript library that allows DAOs, NFT projects and anyone to create an NFT marketplace on Solana in minutes!","Drawing inspiration from Project Serum’s mission to accelerate Solana’s on-chain trading infrastructure, Candy Shop aspires to do the same for the Solana NFT marketplace ecosystem.","Candy Shop provides an easy to integrate marketplace protocol & toolset with a full suite of data endpoints and command APIs to help users deliver a simplistic, seamless and efficient NFT marketplace experience."],"features":["Simple Integration. Integrate marketplace features into your website easily with Candy Shop SDK - your marketplace could be fully operational within a few minutes.","Seamless User Experience. The commands and data endpoints have been designed in a way to simplify user journey and provide a seamless experience for browsing, buying and selling NFTs on your in-house marketplace.","Give More, Earn More. Users save on transaction fees when they transact on your Candy Shop marketplace, and you will also earn 20% of the 1% transaction fee.","Candy Shop Network. Standardized implementation allows you to import other Candy Shop NFT listings directly onto your marketplace or vice versa - creating a network effect of listings for maximum traffic flow","Transparency. Candy Shop is an open source and on-chain protocol, providing your community with full transparency on what is happening behind the scene for your marketplace."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeAreMetaverse/candy-shop/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"dd49a0122fea7d281b4739d917761ed4ea14718700e54891ca169bb0fca0a7a5","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T09:25:56.064Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T09:25:56.064Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Candy Shop is a JavaScript library that allows DAOs, NFT projects and anyone to create an NFT marketplace on Solana in minutes!","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeAreMetaverse/candy-shop/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"dd49a0122fea7d281b4739d917761ed4ea14718700e54891ca169bb0fca0a7a5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeAreMetaverse/candy-shop/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T09:25:56.064Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2022-03-31T14:20:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WeAreMetaverse/candy-shop/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T09:25:56.064Z","hash":"dd49a0122fea7d281b4739d917761ed4ea14718700e54891ca169bb0fca0a7a5","originalBytes":5378,"storedBytes":5378,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["candy","shop","marketplace","sell","nft","npm","yarn","example","import","inside","new","run","start","wallet","address","allows","build","candy-shop","dist","liqnft","publickey","seamless","show","solana","stats","tsdx","user","users","bash","builds","buy","candyshop","custom","data","devnet","earn","endpoints","experience.","features","full","get","i.e.","integrate","interface","key","library","listings","marketplace.","mode","nfts","on-chain","project","protocol","save","src","test","their","transaction","watch","website","about","above.","accelerate","aliasing","another","any","anyone","apis","aspires","been","behind","below.","beta","browsing","built","buying","cancel","candy.buy","candy.cancel","candy.getorders","candy.getstats","can